[00:56.67] I don't know if you can hear me
[01:00.25] Or if you're even there
[01:03.74] I don't know if you would listen to a gypsy's prayer
[01:11.21] Yes, I know I'm just an outcast
[01:15.15] I shouldn't speak to you
[01:19.50] Still I see your face and wonder
[01:24.28] Were you once an outcast too?
[01:32.32] 
[01:36.76] God help the outcasts
[01:40.38] Hungry from birth
[01:43.84] Show them the mercy they don't find on Earth
[01:51.18] God help my people
[01:54.72] We look to you still
[01:58.65] God help the outcasts or nobody will
